@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = PASTE_LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE
@taskId = 1

### 1. Register (repeat to test 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"Learning-JWT-123!"}

### 2. Login, then copy token into @token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"Learning-JWT-123!"}

### 3. Incorrect credentials: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"WrongPassword!"}

### 4. No token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### 5. Create: 201. Save the ID in @taskId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Team meeting","description":"Only visible to its owner","dueDate":null,"userId":999999}

### 6. Filter/paginate: 200, only the authenticated user's tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?search=MEETING&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Update: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Team meeting complete","description":"Finished","isCompleted":true,"dueDate":null}

### 8. Delete: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
